# Code owners — auto-requested as reviewers on PRs that touch matching paths.
# This file only REQUESTS a review; nothing REQUIRES one. None of the rulesets on
# `dev`, `staging` and `main` (infra/github/main.tf) sets
# `require_code_owner_review` to true — `main` sets it false explicitly, `dev` and
# `staging` leave it at the provider default (false) — and all require 0 approvals,
# so a PR on any of those branches can merge with no code-owner approval (#4942).
# Replace @bobikenobi12 with an @alethialabs-io/<team> once teams exist.

# Default owner for everything.
*                           @bobikenobi12

# Deploy / infra / CI — high-blast-radius paths.
/deploy/                    @bobikenobi12
/infra/                     @bobikenobi12
/.github/                   @bobikenobi12
/docker-compose*.yml        @bobikenobi12

# Runner + fleet (provisioning-critical).
/apps/runner/               @bobikenobi12
/apps/console/lib/fleet/    @bobikenobi12
/packages/core/             @bobikenobi12

# DB schema / migrations — linear-chain sensitive.
/apps/console/lib/db/       @bobikenobi12

# The cross-surface formatter contract. Regenerating format-cases.json rewrites an
# EXPECTATION that packages/core/format (Go) is held to — and `--write` is exactly what
# somebody runs when the Go test is red. A review request on every such change.
/packages/format/conformance/ @bobikenobi12

